  "text": "PRODUCTS\nSTORES\nABOUT\nNEWS\nCONTACTS\nTAPTAP\nCART (0)\nMENU\nPRODUCTS\nCART (0)\nSTORES\nABOUT\nNEWS\nDOWNLOADS\nFOR PRESS\nCONTACTS\nEN\nPL\ninfo@artu.works\nDRAG TO ROTATE\nAbout\n\nTaptap is a collection of visually striking yet practical pieces of furniture created by German designer Moritz Putzier. The idea is to create a compact chair with low backrest that is versatile without taking up too much space.\n\nThe design itself is defined by finely crafted details and a playful use of geometric shapes and proportions that give each piece an unconventional character. The Taptap family consists of a chair and a stool, all made of solid ash and lacquered in colour.\n\nDesigner\nMoritz Putzier\nMaterial\nAshwood\nDimensions\nHeight: 726 mm\nWidth: 444 mm\nDepth: 528 mm\nSeat height: 464 mm\nCare instructions\n\nAvoid using detergents and solvents containing alcohol, ammonia, or strong acids. To clean, use a microfiber cloth dampened with neutral detergent and water. Remove staining liquids immediately to prevent absorption into the surface. Always wipe the coating dry after cleaning.\n\nDownloads\nTaptap 3D model\nCertificates\nTechnical sheet\nAlternatives\nEddie\nDesign\nMoritz Putzier\nTaptap 2\nDesign\nMoritz Putzier\nEddie half bar\nDesign\nMoritz Putzier\nEddie bar\nDesign\nMoritz Putzier\nBACK TO TOP\nINFO@ARTU.WORKS\nPRODUCTS\nCART (0)\nSTORES\nDESIGNERS\nABOUT\nNEWS\nTERMS & CONDITIONS\nDOWNLOADS\nFOR PRESS\nCONTACTS\nINSTAGRAM\nFACEBOOK\nPINTEREST\nLINKEDIN\nTIKTOK\nYOUTUBE\n© Artu, 2024 (Aliticon Sp. z o.o.)\nDesigned by TESTFM Agency\nSubscribe to our newsletter\nWe use cookies to improve your browsing experience on our site. For more information, please read our Privacy Policy.\nCustomize\nAccept All",
